# Unreal
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
Build/
.vs/
*.sln
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.suo
*.pdb
# Entregables (se suben a itch, no a git)
*.zip
# Claude Code local
.claude/settings.local.json

# Decision del equipo (2026-11-10): git solo lleva codigo y texto.
# Los assets viajan por la carpeta compartida Incoming de la CENTRAL (SETUP F1c).
# Content is ignored except Content/Data (JSON tuning files are text and belong in git).
**/Content/*
!**/Content/Data/
# Source art (.blend, baked textures) lives on CENTRAL in <project>/SourceArt, like Content.
**/SourceArt/**
!**/SourceArt/**/
!**/SourceArt/**/README.md
!**/SourceArt/**/provenance/*.md
# First-person hand maps: small text sources (character maps + spec), the record of how the hands are made.
!**/SourceArt/PixelArt/Hands/*.txt
!**/SourceArt/PixelArt/Hands/*.json
Incoming/
*.uasset
*.umap

# Copia original del kit (ya desplegado en la raiz)
JamKit/

# Datos locales de maquina (no van al repo)
Tools/AssetSearch/data/
_probe_notes/
MCPProbe59/
Devlog/prejam_evidencia/
_backup_presync/

# Unzipped copies of the packaged build (for play-testing)
Glyphbound/TeamTBD_*/
